# Generic Python/venv rules live in the repo-root .gitignore.
# r5py inputs (large OSM extracts + GTFS feeds), R5's build cache, and the
# generated travel-time grid. Ship the curated model and small station snapshot.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/transit_model.json
!data/station_itineraries.json
*.osm.pbf
*.mapdb
*.mapdb.p
preview.png
